msgstr ""
"Yes. Many clients start with Operational Order or Intelligent Automation and "
"then move to Executive Control to sustain continuous improvement."

#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bitatech_sitio_web.vista_pagina_planes_bitatech
