"plataformas ERP lider, pero integramos con WhatsApp, Power BI y otras "
"herramientas segun la necesidad."
msgstr ""
"We specialize in integrated business ecosystems. We work with leading ERP "
"platforms, but we integrate with WhatsApp, Power BI and other tools as needed."

#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bitatech_sitio_web.vista_pagina_planes_bitatech
msgid "¿Atienden fuera de Panama?"
