msgstr ""
"Our job is to design that structure so your company runs on process, not "
"heroics. So the numbers speak, teams know what to do and you can make "
"decisions based on real data."

#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bitatech_sitio_web.vista_pagina_nosotros_bitatech
msgid "¿Quieres saber como aplicamos esto a tu empresa?"
msgstr "Want to know how we apply this to your company?"

